<title>FINLAND: TABLE-FINNISH CO-OP BANK GROUP H1 PROFIT DOUBLES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-FINNISH CO-OP BANK GROUP H1 PROFIT DOUBLES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 743 vs 369</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses			517 vs 889</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations     1,792 vs 1,838</p>
<p> Capital adequacy (BIS), percent	     11.3 vs 11.3</p>
<p> Interest income				  3,457 vs 4,146</p>
